{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "אותו ואת בנו", :translit "oto v'et beno", :gloss "it and its offspring"} {:he "ועבדו אותו וגו'", :translit "v'avad'tem oto v'gomer", :gloss "and serve him etc."} {:he "ואת בנו", :translit "v'et beno", :gloss "and its offspring"} {:he "אותו ואת בנו לא תשחטו ביום א'", :translit "oto v'et beno lo tishchatu beyom echad", :gloss "it and its offspring you shall not slaughter on one day"} {:he "ועבדו אותו ואת בנו עד בא עת ארצו גם הוא ועבדו בו גוים רבים", :translit "v'avad'tem oto v'et beno ad bo et artzo gam hu v'avad'tem bo goyim rabim", :gloss "and serve him and his offspring until the time of his land come; he and his offspring shall serve in it many nations"} {:he "אותו ואת בנו", :translit "oto v'et beno", :gloss "it and its offspring"} {:he "שור או כשב", :translit "shor o kesev", :gloss "ox or sheep"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "Gezeirah shavah: 'oto v'et beno' links Lev 22:28 to Jeremiah, transferring the prohibition context to Nebuchadnezzar"} {:kind :other, :note "Semantic juxtaposition: 'oto v'et beno' adjacent to 'shor o kesev' teaches the rule applies to consecrated animals"}], :frame {:text "The prohibition of slaughtering an animal and its offspring on the same day appears in Leviticus 22:28. Nebuchadnezzar slaughtered the sons of Zedekiah before his eyes, as narrated in Jeremiah 39:6–7. Jeremiah 27:7 prophesies that nations will serve Nebuchadnezzar, his offspring, and then his kingdom will fall — fulfilled when Belshazzar was killed, as recorded in Daniel 5:30. The Sifrei on Deuteronomy derives that 'oto v'et beno' applies to consecrated animals.", :sources ["Leviticus 22:28" "Jeremiah 39:6–7" "Jeremiah 27:7" "Daniel 5:30" "Sifrei Deuteronomy"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :other, :note "Gezeirah shavah: 'oto v'et beno' links Lev 22:28 to Jeremiah, transferring the prohibition context to Nebuchadnezzar", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Semantic juxtaposition: 'oto v'et beno' adjacent to 'shor o kesev' teaches the rule applies to consecrated animals", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:25:01.836021803Z", :model "glm-5.2"}